  <acceptance-criteria testable="true">
    <criterion testable="true">Spike note confirms (yes/no with evidence) the end-to-end session-dispatch seam works for a Compose Binding — this is the decision the spike unlocks (design §13).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The exact PaneEventBus compose_action_request event shape ({bindingId, selection, args}) a Compose toolbar click must emit is documented.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SSE streaming into the chat surface is observed and recorded.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A ledger SessionOutput write is observed and recorded (ADR-040 storage-precedes-rendering).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Zero new BFF dispatch routes were added (ADR-039); the note states this explicitly.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <execution>
